==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It's highly recommended to build a small stack before hitting the base to overwhelm Cala Maria before it can cause problems. Once Cala Maria is gone, the stage has relatively low threat.

